OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning with some
OL,6,Frain. The Lothians and north Borders
OL,7,Fbrightening up by afternoon with some
OL,8,Fsunshine but rain may linger until
OL,9,Fevening in south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud and patchy rain in the
OL,12,Fsouth at first, but drier and clearer
OL,13,Fconditions across the north will
OL,14,Fspread to all areas through the
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA dry, bright day with plenty
OL,18,Fof warm sunny spells. Sunshine will
OL,19,Fturn a little hazy at times through
OL,20,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
